{"step_index":856,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T20:45:24Z","input_tokens":3771,"cache_read_tokens":278355,"output_tokens":197,"thinking":"Initial hypothesis: Firestore document structure is key. Need to understand `fields` with its types (`stringValue`, etc.), especially for `PATCH` operations (`updateMask`), and creation (`POST`). Also need to know how to retrieve docs (`GET`).\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"firestore rest api documents batchWrite commit delete json format v1\""}},{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"firestore rest api value types mapValue arrayValue integerValue stringValue booleanValue\""}}]}
{"step_index":857,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T20:45:29Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-11T04:45:29+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-11T04:45:34+08:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-11T04:45:29+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-11T04:45:34+08:00\nThe search for \"firestore rest api documents batchWrite commit delete json format v1\" returned the following summary:\nIn the Google Cloud Firestore REST API (v1), there are two distinct ways to execute multiple write and delete operations:\n\n1. **`documents:batchWrite`**: Applies a batch of writes **non-atomically** and independently. Operations can execute out of order, and you cannot have more than one write per document in a single request[1].\n2. **`documents:commit`**: Commits a set of writes **atomically** (either all succeed or all fail together) and in strict order[2].\n\n---\n\n### 1. Endpoint URLs\n\n* **Batch Write (`batchWrite`)**:\n  ```http\n  POST https://firestore.googleapis.com/v1/projects/{projectId}/databases/{databaseId}/documents:batchWrite\n  ```\n* **Atomic Commit (`commit`)**:\n  ```http\n  POST https://firestore.googleapis.com/v1/projects/{projectId}/databases/{databaseId}/documents:commit\n  ```\n  *(Note: For default databases, `{databaseId}` is usually `(default)`[3]).*\n\n---\n\n### 2. JSON Payload Format (`v1`)\n\nBoth endpoints accept a JSON body containing a `writes` array[1][2]. Each element in the array is a `Write` object that can perform operations like `update` (set/upsert), `delete`, or `transform`.\n\n#### Example JSON Payload (Containing a `delete` and an `update`):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"writes\": [\n    {\n      \"delete\": \"projects/my-project-id/databases/(default)/documents/users/user_to_delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"update\": {\n        \"name\": \"projects/my-project-id/databases/(default)/documents/users/user_to_update\",\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"status\": {\n            \"stringValue\": \"active\"\n          },\n          \"loginCount\": {\n            \"integerValue\": \"5\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"updateMask\": {\n        \"fieldPaths\": [\"status\", \"loginCount\"]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Detailed Breakdown of Write Operations inside the JSON\n\n\n<truncated 1388 bytes>\n      \"fields\": {\n            \"price\": { \"doubleValue\": 49.99 },\n            \"inStock\": { \"booleanValue\": true }\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"delete\": \"projects/my-project-id/databases/(default)/documents/temp-cart/cart999\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }'\n```\n\nSources:\n[1] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHsTGlMt9PGJdvn8hzrYhncoB7Ojpa6h1cVp038fmdShVMHXOvM7C5NeyCS3hOB0yr3IW0Op_yPl91IuV3c0nMUL7pmWg46tsmTuGUuuEuKt9gflS1SgbOgvBLbufOB03gZUApPfQl07ZYmXHuY7uguJt-uFQXuwKWts3d2QNrxCt9Q6_QUKcFn-BcOK_0qW2Yt2U41avHl9wSp)\n[2] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE0YwawDr6iC1W0F2BalqW8_Q2a9g2UhBT22vaZNu1oja7h1gRMj4qw2WabWr96ojQyzRHXUdEo1w5dn2noMnZtCvLMtJ5TJ-pau8ggv6wEemNb25ocjguW5KlydIuUnKeb79bNSL5bs292YlhsLW5o67dgnnZHo_6QdNz9xo3QDGjDDpgLpy7hijFexT5FdqAQ1xGRFw==)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH3j6qXj-X_Pxvt26Q5NGL02w4RsSqb7vOkrnyWQcBXT7fzrWEUoT7s739YwF3IZ7W0cf6O7eoCDHYOa5PbKd4h-Fv3RntmYJCp3-wK6Dqnir1RVLeEmanZynddGlwnpL7-X8vO95IZSopeiWjUP6fxtgVkLYMv2C25)\n[4] [postman.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFm3SDLdBCM-bdxGGzvYJ0mfKIBE8CKLzAV7sB-YuXGnVZExno3eESXAFysbgNb4PV6ZHlpzsiynZbzzDhSUXJntKWBO-xsbjck2GfmPCQSN_7oEa2Xeru60eF5U3cbviGd7wI4r_w5adWFaFm6etXE-GNw9fTRM1zLwsmBiLHyrAynUpToqqUTTJ91KX5MBiMEFL2r8N-7CXMC9YGoQQYIGmD-Nai7)\n[5] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFLhGUg92MFKD4_tabEE_FGkTqjRqz5_rGka7lKbgmy